WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.740
Coach wanted.

2
00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:03.180
No experience needed.

3
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.330
Strong stomach required.

4
00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:06.770
Glizzy Manager.

5
00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.210
Pick one of sixteen new

6
00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:09.650
faces, or write your own

7
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:10.690
name, and take them

8
00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:12.120
through the league.

9
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.600
The match is simple.

10
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:14.760
Hide the glizzy under a

11
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:16.800
hat, a sock or a box.

12
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.200
The other one guesses.

13
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.080
Three grabs,

14
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.150
you eat it, you lose.

15
00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:22.430
You don't play.

16
00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:23.790
You prepare.

17
00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:24.990
Three months before each

18
00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:27.150
cup, one move a month:

19
00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.510
train, rest,

20
00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:30.110
or media for cash.

21
00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:31.670
Money goes on security,

22
00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:32.510
investments and

23
00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:33.630
sabotage.

24
00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:34.990
And watch the card:

25
00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:36.550
ego over seventy-five,

26
00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:37.390
and they play on their

27
00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:38.340
own.

28
00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:39.620
Four cups a year,

29
00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:40.740
straight into a bracket

30
00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:41.980
of sixteen.

31
00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:43.900
A title, twenty points.

32
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.513
A win, three.

33
00:00:45.513 --> 00:00:47.460
A loss, minus one.

34
00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:48.460
First to two hundred and

35
00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:49.620
fifty is Glizzy

36
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:50.890
Overlord.

37
00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:52.170
There are sponsors,

38
00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:53.770
who double as parties.

39
00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:54.890
The Assembly.

40
00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:55.930
Elections.

41
00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:56.890
Favors.

42
00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.480
You'll figure it out.

43
00:00:58.480 --> 00:00:59.920
Glizzy Rivals:

44
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:00.800
same league,

45
00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:01.840
multiplayer.

46
00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:03.200
Up to eight coaches,

47
00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.520
one room code.

48
00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:05.440
Everyone's off-season

49
00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.560
runs at once,

50
00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:07.240
you watch the cup

51
00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:08.440
together, bet,

52
00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:10.470
and sabotage each other.

53
00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.700
Out-eat your friends.
